  "description_short": "Relaxed coastal pub in Dana Bay serving hearty meals, cold drinks, and genuine hospitality.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in the quiet seaside village of Dana Bay, Travellers offers the kind of easy-going atmosphere that keeps locals coming back and visitors feeling right at home. The pub vibe is friendly without being rowdy, making it equally suited to a family lunch or drinks with mates after a day at the beach.\n\nThe menu covers all the classics you'd want from a neighbourhood pub — burgers, steaks, seafood platters, and proper pub grub that hits the spot. Portions are generous, prices are fair, and the kitchen knows how to deliver consistent comfort food. The outdoor seating area is perfect for catching the sea breeze, especially on warm Garden Route afternoons.\n\nWhether you're stopping in for a quick bite, settling in to watch the game, or just want a cold one with a view of the coast, Travellers delivers on that unpretentious pub experience that Dana Bay residents have come to rely on.",
